    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You were never alone in your body.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Moon (Ancient Blood).</strong> You carry something older than law. Memory moves through you. It expects to matter.</p>\n<h3>Archetype Effects</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your presence amplifies symbolism, inherited legitimacy, buried memory, and eerie cultural authority. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Soft Power</strong> in faction calculus in Bad Eden’s faction calculus.</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit; those are granted automatically by the Tier Engine at the appropriate character levels.</li>\n</ul>",
